{"content_kind":"narrative.field","definition":{"id":"sump_atmosphere","index_mapping_version":1,"metadata":{"chapter":2,"title":"The Price","title_ko":"가격"},"rows":[{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/sump_atmosphere/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch2_sump_breathing_walls.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":10,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":0,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":0,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"The Sump breathed.","text_ko":"섬프는 숨을 쉬었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/sump_atmosphere/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":10,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":1,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":1,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Not literally, but the walls pulsed with a rhythm that made the torchlight dance. Underground water channels ran beneath the floor, carrying whispers from somewhere deeper.","text_ko":"말 그대로는 아니었지만, 벽이 횃불을 춤추게 하는 박동으로 고동쳤다. 바닥 밑으로는 지하 수로가 흘렀고, 깊은 어딘가의 속삭임을 실어 날랐다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/sump_atmosphere/2","jump":null,"original_index":2,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/chapter_expansion/ch02_sump_waiting_alcoves_v1.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":10,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":2,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Alcoves lined the tunnel walls. In each one, someone waited. Buyers. Sellers. People whose faces you forgot the moment you looked away.","text_ko":"터널 벽을 따라 골방들이 늘어서 있었다. 그 하나하나에서 누군가 기다렸다. 사는 자. 파는 자. 시선을 돌리는 순간 얼굴이 잊히는 사람들."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/sump_atmosphere/3","jump":null,"original_index":3,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":10,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":3,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":3,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"A woman in an alcove held up a vial. Inside, something silver swam in slow circles.","text_ko":"한 골방의 여자가 약병을 들어 보였다. 그 안에서 은빛 무언가가 느린 원을 그리며 헤엄치고 있었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/sump_atmosphere/4","jump":null,"original_index":4,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":10,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":4,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":4,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"'First Kiss,' she mouthed. 'Cheap.'","text_ko":"그녀는 '첫 키스'라고 말했다. '값이 싼.'"}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/sump_atmosphere/5","jump":null,"original_index":5,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":10,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":5,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":5,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Arrel kept walking. He didn't look back. Looking back was how you got lost down here, not in the tunnels, but in other people's pasts.","text_ko":"아렐은 계속 걸었다. 돌아보지 않았다. 이 아래에서 길을 잃는 방법이 그것이었다, 터널이 아니라, 타인의 과거 속에서."}}]},"dialect":"field","extractor_version":"memoria-narrative/1","schema_version":1,"semantic_sha256":"bd5abca1b67c12da4c6c55f627e786aaaef758a831822c2ab462ee39d3eb39d6","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949","sources":[{"path":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","sha256_utf8_lf":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21"},{"path":"scripts/systems/dialogue_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"b6163afcadbee0ad9e799d17caa57e16b949a3bc2a3dbd418391aed929ccce4a"},{"path":"scripts/systems/scene_flow.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"733bdd697ceaa1a82976164be5455ac792f94b5ec2a6c02716a5492c1ae4930d"},{"path":"scripts/ui/vn_scene.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"8da6f03fa6ff1e9695f3fcb985a79eacf96d3b74f5f49e2489c831d9eccc26ce"},{"path":"scenes/main/vn_host.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"a5a6c2295916b494cff559760616d9734d05652e20f7e531f930984a71246275"},{"path":"scenes/maps/verdan_market.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"25ff88bad40722ccecc1f02b270201b6b0771031eec511592afbcab88ad94ce3"},{"path":"scripts/systems/memory_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"5551c4fe5541e5201541a4dcee835ae4ec8fc7404167a4fc81e547e3b0520938"},{"path":"scripts/utils/journey_oath.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"39610117fa7a7b357960a931b024a28b1a27068f5da5d3602d67829b7a3d2635"},{"path":"scripts/core/game_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"302846dfed4304f009b39a728812ac91484cfe6b858e235e661e84fa7fb9e6d1"}]}
